Package: EpiSegDiff
Title: Replicate-Aware Multi-Scale Differential Epigenomic Segmentation
Version: 0.8.1
Authors@R: person("EpiSegDiff", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "episegdiff@example.org")
Description: Detect differential epigenomic structure without requiring
    predefined peaks, then characterize intensity changes and
    boundary/topology dynamics. Assay-specific observation models are
    preserved; segmentation targets the genomic condition effect.
